<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia wants Newmonth to cut gold stake.</title>
<headline>Indonesia wants Newmonth to cut gold stake.</headline>
<dateline>BALIKPAPAN, Indonesia 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia has asked the U.S. Newmont Mining Corp to cut its 80-percent stake in the Batu Hijau goldfield to 49 percent, the director-general of mining, Adjat Sudradjat said on Friday.</p>
</text>
